  unitName: Sapphire Noble Stein
  unitId: 20837
  unitNumber: 1402
  description: He was said to be a contrarian who always condescended to others,
    but he always showed respect to Grahdens as the one who acknowledged his abilities.
    This was also said to be due to the unfortunate life he had lived despite his
    intellectual brilliance. Were he still alive today, he likely would have expanded
    the influence of the Akras Summoners' Hall even further through major contributions
    to diplomacy and other political activities.
  summonDesc: The one who acknowledged me<br>was kind, and also terrifying.<br>Figure
    out what that means for yourself.
  fusionDesc: This is what you get for coming at me. Impressive, right?<br>Come on,
    you can flatter me more, you know.
  evoDesc: Huh, does this mean<br>that you're impressed with me too?<br>Fine, then.
    I may even try a little.
